---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updatedDate = '2026-07-11';
const siteUrl = "https://paintprocalculator.com";

// Breadcrumb Schema
const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": siteUrl
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Affiliate Disclosure",
      "item": `${siteUrl}/affiliate-disclosure`
    }
  ]
};

// Article Schema
const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Affiliate Disclosure - PaintPro Calculator",
  "description": "Affiliate disclosure for PaintPro Calculator. Transparency about how we earn commissions and how that does not affect editorial recommendations.",
  "url": `${siteUrl}/affiliate-disclosure`,
  "datePublished": "2025-12-26",
  "dateModified": updatedDate,
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Zack Pearson",
    "url": `${siteUrl}/about`
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "ProBuild Digital LLC",
    "url": "https://probuilddigital.com"
  },
  "inLanguage": "en-US"
};
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure - Paint Calculator | PaintPro Calculator"
  description="Affiliate disclosure for PaintPro Calculator. Transparency about how we earn commissions and how that does not affect editorial recommendations."
>
  <Header />

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)} />

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 md:p-10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-heading mb-6">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">
        By <a href="/about" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">Zack Pearson</a>
        <span class="mx-2">·</span>
        Last updated August 23, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-6">
        <section>
          <p class="text-lg text-body">
            PaintPro Calculator is free to use and runs without a paywall. The site contains affiliate links, and I earn a commission when you buy through one. That commission covers hosting and the time I spend keeping the calculators accurate. It never changes the price you pay.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">What an affiliate link is</h2>
          <p class="text-body">
            An affiliate link is a tracked URL. When you click one and then make a purchase on the destination site (most often Amazon), I receive a small commission from the retailer. The price you pay is identical to what you would pay going directly. Nothing is added to your cart or your bill.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Programs I participate in</h2>
          <p class="text-body">
            PaintPro Calculator is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body mt-3">
            From time to time the site may also participate in lead-generation partnerships with painting contractors and home-services networks. Those relationships are disclosed within the relevant page or form.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">How affiliate links affect what I recommend</h2>
          <p class="text-body">
            They don't. If the best paint roller for the job is sold by a brand with no affiliate program, I link to the manufacturer page anyway. If a higher-commission alternative is worse on quality or price, the lower-commission product still wins. The full editorial process is on the <a href="/editorial-standards" class="text-primary hover:underline">editorial standards page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">My commitments</h2>
          <div class="bg-light-gray rounded-xl p-6">
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-body">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                <span>I only recommend products I would buy or have already bought myself.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                <span>Affiliate relationships never change which products I recommend.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                <span>You never pay more by clicking through one of my links.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                </svg>
                <span>The calculator itself contains no affiliate links and is not influenced by any product partnership.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">FTC compliance</h2>
          <p class="text-body">
            This disclosure follows guidance from the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/disclosures-101-social-media-influencers" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:underline">Endorsement Guides</a>. Articles that contain affiliate links also include an inline disclosure near the top so it's clear before you click.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Lead generation partners</h2>
          <p class="text-body">
            When you request quotes from local painters through forms on this site, the request is sent to a lead-generation partner that matches you with contractors. PaintPro Calculator may receive a referral fee. The service is free to you, you're under no obligation to hire any contractor who responds, and your contact details are handled per the lead-gen partner's privacy policy and our own <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">privacy policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-heading mt-8 mb-4">Questions</h2>
          <p class="text-body">
            If anything on this page is unclear or if you think a specific article isn't disclosing affiliate links properly, email <a href="mailto:zack.pearson@probuilddigital.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">zack.pearson@probuilddigital.com</a> and I'll fix it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-8">
            Thank you for using the calculator and for supporting the site through these links.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-border">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-medium hover:underline"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
          </svg>
          Back to Calculator
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
